    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh wow, i wasn't expecting that metaphor but it actually hits home perfectly. the idea of them just nibbling away at my energy is exactly how the crashes feel.\n\ncan you expand on that a bit? like, if we're using this goblin idea to explain it to my kids, how would you describe what happens when i eat something really high in sugar? like, do the goblins go into a frenzy or something?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
